# Testing Guide (Vitest)

## Test Environments

- Node tests: [vitest.node.config.ts](mdc:vitest.node.config.ts)
- Edge runtime tests: [vitest.edge.config.ts](mdc:vitest.edge.config.ts)

Use Node for Node-specific behavior (`*.node.test.ts` is excluded from Edge).
The Edge configuration runs the other `*.test.ts` files, including shared
model and adapter tests.

## Commands

- Run all tests: `npm test`
- Watch mode: `npm run test:watch`
- Node only: `npm run test:node`
- Edge only: `npm run test:edge`

## Stubbing Network

- Mock SAP SDK clients using the existing `vi.mock` patterns in
  [src/sap-ai-language-model.test.ts](mdc:src/sap-ai-language-model.test.ts).
  Provider settings do not expose a custom `fetch` option.
- For V3 streaming flows, assert `LanguageModelV3StreamPart` events via the
  `doStream` pipeline (see
  [src/sap-ai-language-model.ts](mdc:src/sap-ai-language-model.ts)).
- For V2 facade tests, assert `LanguageModelV2StreamPart` events via the
  V2 adapters (see [src/sap-ai-language-model-v2.ts](mdc:src/sap-ai-language-model-v2.ts)).
- For V4 facade tests, assert `LanguageModelV4StreamPart` events and V4 prompt
  normalization (see [src/sap-ai-language-model-v4.test.ts](mdc:src/sap-ai-language-model-v4.test.ts)).

## Test Patterns

- Validate message templating: cover
  [src/convert-to-sap-messages.ts](mdc:src/convert-to-sap-messages.ts).
- Validate error propagation using helpers in
  [src/sap-ai-error.ts](mdc:src/sap-ai-error.ts).
- Validate structured-output conversion and backend errors without assuming
  model-family filtering: schema formats and `n` are forwarded to SAP.

## V2 Facade Test Files

The V2 facade layer has dedicated test files:

- [src/sap-ai-provider-v2.test.ts](mdc:src/sap-ai-provider-v2.test.ts) — Tests
  for `SAPAIProviderV2` factory and `ProviderV2` interface compliance.
- [src/sap-ai-language-model-v2.test.ts](mdc:src/sap-ai-language-model-v2.test.ts) —
  Tests for `SAPAILanguageModelV2` facade including `doGenerate`/`doStream` V2 contracts.
- [src/sap-ai-embedding-model-v2.test.ts](mdc:src/sap-ai-embedding-model-v2.test.ts) —
  Tests for `SAPAIEmbeddingModelV2` facade including `doEmbed` V2 contract.
- [src/sap-ai-adapters-v3-to-v2.test.ts](mdc:src/sap-ai-adapters-v3-to-v2.test.ts) —
  Tests for V3→V2 type adapter functions.

When modifying facade files, cover affected V2/V3/V4 observable contracts.
V4 embedding integration is covered in
[src/sap-ai-provider-v4.test.ts](mdc:src/sap-ai-provider-v4.test.ts); language-model
and adapter tests are co-located with their corresponding source files.
